%% 1. Find a gift with AI Toy Finder
flowchart TB
A["1. Open AI Toy Finder"] --> B["2. Describe age, occasion, quantity and budget"]
B --> C{"Intent clear?"}
C -->|No| D["Clarify per-item vs total budget"]
D --> B
C -->|Yes| E["Typesense filters and ranking<br/>Medusa checks price and quantity"]
C -->|Model unavailable| F["Keyword and filter fallback"]
F --> E
E --> G["3. View matches, grounded reasons and refine chips"]
G --> H{"4. Refine?"}
H -->|Chip| E
H -->|New text| B
H -->|Choose product| I["5. Open product page<br/>Current price, options and pincode estimate"]

%% 2. Browse the catalogue
flowchart TB
A["1. Shop by age, occasion, theme, skill or category<br/>Or Trending / Viral right now"] --> B["Medusa taxonomy and Payload curated content"]
B --> C["2. View product listing<br/>Typesense results and CDN images"]
C --> D["3. Filter and sort<br/>Selections retained in URL"]
D --> E{"Matches?"}
E -->|No| F["Broaden filters"]
F --> D
E -->|Yes| G["4. Open product page<br/>Medusa loads current variants and prices"]

%% 3. Add a product to the cart
flowchart TB
A["1. Open product"] --> B["2. Choose colour / variant"]
B --> C{"3. Personalisation offered?<br/>Proposed enhancement"}
C -->|Yes| D["Enter name<br/>Server validates and prices surcharge"]
C -->|No| E["4. Read safety and materials<br/>Choose optional gift add-ons"]
D --> E
E --> F["5. Enter pincode<br/>Check serviceability and estimate"]
F --> G["6. Add to cart"]
G --> H{"Variant, quantity and configuration valid?"}
H -->|No| I["Show correction or stock message"]
I --> B
H -->|Yes| J["Open cart with server-priced lines<br/>Cart is not a stock guarantee"]

%% 4. Send a gift
flowchart TB
A["1. Select toy and add to cart"] --> B["2. Open Gift Studio"]
B --> C["3. Choose wrap<br/>Signature / Boys / Girls / Unisex / Eco"]
C --> D["4. Note up to 200 characters<br/>Hide-price preference"]
D --> E["5. Recipient address and pincode<br/>Date / slot / same-day when supported"]
E --> F["Check shipping eligibility and capacity<br/>Date and slot selection is an enhancement"]
F --> G{"6. Identity"}
G -->|Sign in| H["Verify +91 SMS OTP<br/>Collect profile details when needed"]
G -->|Guest| I["Scoped guest checkout"]
H --> J["7. Select payment method<br/>Server applies eligible prepaid discount"]
I --> J
J --> K["8. Choose WhatsApp updates<br/>Separate marketing consent"]
K --> L{"9. Place order"}
L -->|Prepaid| M["Hosted gateway payment<br/>Server verifies state"]
L -->|COD| N["Validate pincode and COD rules<br/>Record unpaid collection"]
M --> O{"Payment confirmed?"}
O -->|Pending or failed| P["Show status or retry safely<br/>Do not duplicate charges"]
P --> M
O -->|Yes| Q["Complete order and gift snapshots"]
N --> Q
Q --> R["Show confirmation<br/>Worker sends eligible messages and packing instructions"]
%% One recipient per order is proposed. Invoice interpretation needs approval.

%% 5. Buy for yourself
flowchart TB
A["1. Select variant and add to cart"] --> B["2. Skip Gift Studio<br/>No optional wrap charges"]
B --> C["3. Enter address and pincode<br/>Saved address requires authenticated ownership"]
C --> D["Check serviceability and shipping charges"]
D --> E{"4. Identity"}
E -->|Sign in| F["Verify +91 SMS OTP"]
E -->|Guest| G["Scoped guest session"]
F --> H["5. Reprice and check stock"]
G --> H
H --> I{"Payment method"}
I -->|Prepaid| J["Hosted checkout and verified payment state"]
I -->|COD| K["Eligibility check and unpaid collection obligation"]
J --> L{"Completion permitted?"}
K --> L
L -->|No| M["Show pending state or correct checkout details"]
M --> H
L -->|Yes| N["6. Confirmation"]
N --> O["My orders or signed guest link<br/>Track parcel"]

%% 6. Track an order
flowchart TB
A{"Access route"} -->|Account| B["1. Open Login / Account"]
B --> C["2. Verify +91 SMS OTP"]
A -->|Message link| D["2. Open scoped tracking link"]
C --> E{"Authorised order access?"}
D --> E
E -->|Expired link or not verified| F["Request renewed verification"]
F --> C
E -->|Yes| G["3. View confirmed / shipped / out for delivery / delivered"]
H["Authenticated courier events<br/>Deduplicate and reconcile"] --> G
H --> I["4. Worker sends eligible WhatsApp / email updates"]
G --> J{"COD order?"}
J -->|Yes| K["5. Pay delivery person"]
K --> L["Record collection<br/>Reconcile merchant remittance separately"]
J -->|No| M["Delivery complete"]

%% 7. Return gifts or a bulk order
flowchart TB
A["1. Find suitable toys<br/>Clarify per-item vs total budget"] --> B["2. Set quantities and add items"]
B --> C["Medusa checks stock and approved quantity pricing"]
C --> D["3. Optional wrap and note per child<br/>Distinct configurations stay separate"]
D --> E{"4. Checkout or quote?"}
E -->|Checkout available| F["Sign in or guest checkout"]
E -->|Quote required| G["Submit site / WhatsApp inquiry"]
G --> H["Staff confirms price and stock"]
H --> I["Approved quote and controlled checkout link"]
I --> J["Sign in and revalidate quote expiry / stock"]
J --> K["Pay and complete order"]
F --> K
K --> L["5. Track through My orders or messages"]
%% Inquiry and unpaid quote are not confirmed paid orders.

