B --> C["3. Expert sends product links"]
C --> D["Open storefront<br/>Fetch current prices and availability"]
D --> E["4. Add recommended items"]
E --> F{"Book video call?<br/>Proposed enhancement"}
F -->|Yes| G["Check staff availability<br/>Record appointment and meeting link"]
F -->|No| H["5. Open cart and choose gift options"]
G --> H
